        {
          "text": "Uzakuthi kubo: Itsho njalo iNkosi uJehova; Ngiyakwenza ukuba lesi saga siphele, bangabe besakhuluma ngaso kwa-Israyeli; kodwa uthi kubo: Izinsuku sezisondele, nomsebenzi wakho konke okubonwayo.",
